{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号白色标题首先吸引视线，字号最大、位置靠上、亮度突出。随后视线容易被中部两块同样醒目的粗体白字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始具体担心有一天对方不再需要自己的陪伴，甚至不愿意再和自己待在一起。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、害怕被疏远。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他因此突然安静下来，不敢继续往远处想；随后想到对方一直没有退开、两人眼下仍然亲近，于是又有一点高兴。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块大号白色文字都很显眼，中部两块也在争夺主视线。\",\n    \"标题本身较长，具体担忧需要扫过两行才能完整拿到。\",\n    \"后两块又呈现了从不敢继续想，到重新获得一点高兴的情绪变化，需要再看才能理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "66cfa3d4-6541-4b08-94f8-c87078ebe193", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030029248334Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:01:03.443578+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e274c7e3c4e59f3d645af2f2491f0bb3ff437fa799554cada5277c9091a9c060", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a